<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27469" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίσκος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικεῖν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quoit,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.774
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.186
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				200
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				533
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίσκου οὖρα</span>
			<i>quoit's</i> cast, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.431
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιθίνοις ἐν δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					1.25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>anything quoit-shaped:</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>dish, trencher,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				11.371
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				30.24
			</span></i>; <i>salver</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				388ii22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>round mirror,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				6.18
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> the sun's
				<i>disk,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				2.46
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				2.24.1
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>gong,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				5.28
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>reliquary,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Aed.</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>marigold, Calendula arvensis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				12
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικεῖν.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
